## Java requirement

This project targets JDK ${model.javaVersion} through Gradle Toolchains. Your default system Java may be newer, but Gradle must be able to locate a JDK ${model.javaVersion} installation.

Check detected toolchains with:

- Windows: `gradlew.bat -q javaToolchains`
- Linux/macOS: `./gradlew -q javaToolchains`

## Run

H2 is the default database. Run `./gradlew bootRun` or `gradlew.bat bootRun` on Windows.

For PostgreSQL use `--spring.profiles.active=postgres` and set DB_URL, DB_USERNAME and DB_PASSWORD.
